SUMMARY:GUNBUN Wine Bingo (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Gay Bingo Charlotte: Pop Icons & Great Wine \nGUNBUN is proud to be the wine provider for Gay Bingo Charlotte! Enjoy a lively evening of drag performances\, pop-icon costumes\, and bingo-inspired fun supporting RAIN’s programs in the fight to end HIV. Gather your crew\, raise a glass\, and celebrate community for a great cause. \nSaturday\, November 14\, 2026 | Charlotte Convention Center\, Crown Ballroom\nReception at 5 PM | Show at 7 PM\nTickets: $35 per person | Reserved tables of 10: $500–$600 \nLearn more & get tickets
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/wines-in-wild-2/
CATEGORIES:GB on the Road,Wine Reception,Experiences,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GB-Events-Page-Banner-17.png
END:VEVENT
